     fhir:Element.extension [
       fhir:index 0 ;
       fhir:Extension.url [ fhir:value "type" ] ;
       fhir:Extension.valueCode [ fhir:value "documentation" ]
     ], [
       fhir:index 1 ;
       fhir:Extension.url [ fhir:value "text" ] ;
       fhir:Extension.valueMarkdown [ fhir:value "Maintenance search expression: `(morphine AND NOT diamorphine AND NOT 6-Monoacetylmorphine) (=system:Urine)`. The compose anchors at two trunk LP codes - LP16093-4 and LP15174-3 - using `concept is-a` filters scoped to SYSTEM=LP7681-2 (urine) and CLASSTYPE=1 (lab test). To regenerate: re-run the search expression as a LOINC hierarchy query, add any newly-discovered trunk LP code as another is-a filter, then re-expand." ]
     ] ;
